# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Template for the env files used by Docker Compose.
#
#  Local dev:   docker-compose.yml hardcodes PUBLIC_PB_URL=http://localhost:8090,
#               so you don't need a file for it. (`astro dev` on the host reads
#               astro/.env — see astro/.env.example.)
#  On the VPS:  the deploy workflows write a `.env` next to the compose file with
#               the per-environment PocketBase URL:
#                 /var/www/html/micio86dev.it/.env        → PROD_PB_URL=https://pb.micio86dev.it
#                 /var/www/html/stage.micio86dev.it/.env  → STAGE_PB_URL=https://pb-stage.micio86dev.it
#               (docker-compose.{prod,stage}.yml interpolate ${PROD_PB_URL} /
#               ${STAGE_PB_URL} into the astro container's PUBLIC_PB_URL.)
#
#  NEVER commit a filled-in copy — .gitignore keeps .env / .env.* out, and this
#  is a public repo. (None of these are secrets — PocketBase URLs and a site
#  origin are all public — but keep the habit.)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── RUNTIME — public PocketBase base URL (injected into the astro container) ──
# The contact form POSTs straight to ${PUBLIC_PB_URL}/api/collections/contacts/records
# from the browser, and the SSR server reads it for projects/services. Must be
# browser-reachable. Falls back to http://localhost:8090 if unset.
PUBLIC_PB_URL=https://pb.micio86dev.it
# In CI these are the repo secrets that get written into the VPS .env above:
PROD_PB_URL=https://pb.micio86dev.it
STAGE_PB_URL=https://pb-stage.micio86dev.it

# ── RUNTIME — public contact email (single source of truth; see astro/src/lib/site.ts) ──
# Used by the contact aside, the footer mailto, and the contact-form fallback
# message. Inlined into the browser bundle (PUBLIC_ prefix). Falls back to
# micio86dev@gmail.com if unset.
PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=hello@micio86dev.it

# ── BUILD-TIME — canonical site origin (Docker build arg, read by astro.config.mjs) ──
# Used for <link rel="canonical">, hreflang, sitemap. Hardcoded per environment
# in the deploy workflows.
SITE_URL=https://micio86dev.it

# ── RUNTIME — public site origin (used by the /sitemap.xml and /robots.txt SSR endpoints) ──
# Mirrors SITE_URL but read at container start (like PUBLIC_PB_URL). If unset, the endpoints
# fall back to Astro.site (the SITE_URL build arg). Hardcoded per environment in
# docker-compose.{prod,stage}.yml.
PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://micio86dev.it
# Staging equivalent (set in docker-compose.stage.yml):
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://stage.micio86dev.it

# ── PocketBase first-run superuser (local dev convenience only) ───────────
# Not used by Astro. Handy for bootstrapping the local PocketBase admin:
#   docker compose exec pocketbase /pb/pocketbase superuser upsert "$PB_ADMIN_EMAIL" "$PB_ADMIN_PASSWORD"
PB_ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
PB_ADMIN_PASSWORD=changeme
